                <pb facs="0854" n="840" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg840"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 1]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Draft Communiqué</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Conversations between the United States, United Kingdom, and Soviet Union
                    delegations in Washington regarding the establishment of a World Security
                    Organization have now been completed. These conversations have been useful and
                    have led to a large measure of agreement on recommendations for the general
                    framework of the Organization, and in particular for the machinery required to
                    maintain peace and security. The three delegations are making reports to their
                    respective Governments who will consider these reports and will in due course
                    issue a simultaneous statement on the subject.</p>
            </div>
